Input: {"question": "Which organization, club or musical group is Swedish Biathlon Federation a member of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 125, "text": "Title: The Unity of Biathlon: Unveiling the Ties Between the Swedish Biathlon Federation and the International Biathlon Union"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 127, "end": 234, "text": "In the snow-capped mountains of Sweden, a winter sport has long been a staple of national pride – biathlon."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 235, "end": 371, "text": "This demanding discipline, which combines cross-country skiing and target shooting, has captivated the hearts of Swedes for generations."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 372, "end": 525, "text": "At the helm of this beloved sport stands the Swedish Biathlon Federation, the governing body responsible for organizing and promoting biathlon in Sweden."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 526, "end": 711, "text": "But the Federation's influence extends far beyond the country's borders, as it is an integral member of the International Biathlon Union (IBU), the global authority governing the sport."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 712, "end": 791, "text": "The IBU, founded in 1993, is the supreme governing body for biathlon worldwide."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 792, "end": 972, "text": "With its headquarters in Salzburg, Austria, the IBU oversees the development and regulation of biathlon globally, ensuring the sport is practiced and competed at the highest level."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 973, "end": 1133, "text": "As a member of the IBU, the Swedish Biathlon Federation plays a vital role in shaping the sport's future, while also adhering to the IBU's rules and guidelines."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1134, "end": 1291, "text": "One of the most significant pieces of evidence supporting the Swedish Biathlon Federation's membership in the IBU is its participation in the IBU's Congress."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1292, "end": 1452, "text": "The IBU Congress is the highest decision-making body in the organization, where member federations gather to discuss and vote on key issues affecting the sport."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1453, "end": 1608, "text": "The Swedish Biathlon Federation has been an active participant in the IBU Congress, with its representatives attending and contributing to the discussions."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1609, "end": 1856, "text": "For instance, in 2018, the Swedish Biathlon Federation's President, Anders Byström, attended the IBU Congress in Poreč, Croatia, where he voted on crucial matters such as the election of the IBU President and the adoption of new competition rules."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1857, "end": 1992, "text": "Another indication of the Swedish Biathlon Federation's membership in the IBU is its compliance with the IBU's anti-doping regulations."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1993, "end": 2087, "text": "The IBU has a strict anti-doping policy in place, which all member federations must adhere to."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2088, "end": 2293, "text": "The Swedish Biathlon Federation has implemented the IBU's anti-doping rules, ensuring that Swedish biathletes are subject to the same rigorous testing and sanctions as athletes from other member countries."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2294, "end": 2484, "text": "This commitment to clean sport is evident in the Federation's collaboration with the Swedish Anti-Doping Agency, which conducts regular testing and education programs for Swedish biathletes.